      "updated": 1791601547381,
      "created": 1791600789825,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Requirements:\n\n- should limit user requests\n- use ip or userId or other properties\n- client side vs server side vs in the middle rate limiter\n- distributed?\n- which algo? fixed, sliding, token bucket, leaky bucket\n- should be fault tolerant\n\n\n",
