    {
      "id": "XDVpK6jItV3-xj-RFn2ez",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1366.1581116617863,
      "y": 8487.283926648563,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 875,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bCB",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1500490794,
      "version": 1711,
      "versionNonce": 250347242,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792209695799,
      "created": 1792204725590,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "FUNC REQ:\n- user should be able to browse events, query them using filters\n- user can choose an event and then select certain number of seats\n- user can block the seats for certain time period \n\nNON FUNC REQ:\n- Scale: 100M DAU are browsing events, 100M/10^5 = 1k reads per sec, \n       with peak factor 5 x 1k = 5k rps\n- No two users can book same seat so strong consistency during booking\n- We should also show all the current events so high availability. if\nthe event is sold out user will not be able to book seats\n- Performance: p95 latency under 200ms for reading info\n- Reliability: 99.9% uptime \n- Security: authenticated users will be able to book\n\nENTITIES:\nUser(userId, name, info..)\nEvent(eventId, name, location, seatMap<seat1(blocked, exptime), 2, 3...>\nTicket(ticketId, eventId, userId, seatIds[], payment info)\n\nAPI:\nGET /v1/event?city=arlington?date=2026-12-20\nResponse: {events[]}\n\nGET /v1/event/{eventId}\nResponse: {seat map, event details}\n\nPOST /v1/event/block/{eventId}\nbody: {seats[]}\nResponse: {holdId, status, validTill}\n\nPOST /v1/event/book/{eventId}\nbody: {holdId, payment details}\nResponse: {Ticket}\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "FUNC REQ:\n- user should be able to browse events, query them using filters\n- user can choose an event and then select certain number of seats\n- user can block the seats for certain time period \n\nNON FUNC REQ:\n- Scale: 100M DAU are browsing events, 100M/10^5 = 1k reads per sec, \n       with peak factor 5 x 1k = 5k rps\n- No two users can book same seat so strong consistency during booking\n- We should also show all the current events so high availability. if the event is sold out user will not be able to book seats\n- Performance: p95 latency under 200ms for reading info\n- Reliability: 99.9% uptime \n- Security: authenticated users will be able to book\n\nENTITIES:\nUser(userId, name, info..)\nEvent(eventId, name, location, seatMap<seat1(blocked, exptime), 2, 3...>\nTicket(ticketId, eventId, userId, seatIds[], payment info)\n\nAPI:\nGET /v1/event?city=arlington?date=2026-12-20\nResponse: {events[]}\n\nGET /v1/event/{eventId}\nResponse: {seat map, event details}\n\nPOST /v1/event/block/{eventId}\nbody: {seats[]}\nResponse: {holdId, status, validTill}\n\nPOST /v1/event/book/{eventId}\nbody: {holdId, payment details}\nResponse: {Ticket}\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
