      "updated": 1792272839151,
      "created": 1792263823779,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Design a video generation system similar to Sora that allows users to\nsubmit prompts for video generation, retrieve generated videos, and\nreceive real-time status updates via webhooks, utilizing a scalable\nmulti-worker architecture to handle concurrent video generation\nrequests.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Design a video generation system similar to Sora that allows users to submit prompts for video generation, retrieve generated videos, and receive real-time status updates via webhooks, utilizing a scalable multi-worker architecture to handle concurrent video generation requests.",
