      "updated": 1792272839151,
      "created": 1792263900849,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "FUNC REQ:\n- user can submit nl queries, generate video\n- user can track status\n\nNON FUNC REQ:\n- async processing in background, p95 latency under few seconds\n- scale: 1M DAU -> 10 req per sec, peak factor 30 rps submitted \n- security: authenticated \n- storage: 2min video -> 100MB x 1M per day = 100PB per year (object\nstorage)\n\nENTITIES:\nUser (userId, name, info about user)\nTask (taskId, userId, status, user query...)\n\nAPI:\nPOST /v1/video\nbody: {query}\nResponse: {taskId, status}\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "FUNC REQ:\n- user can submit nl queries, generate video\n- user can track status\n\nNON FUNC REQ:\n- async processing in background, p95 latency under few seconds\n- scale: 1M DAU -> 10 req per sec, peak factor 30 rps submitted \n- security: authenticated \n- storage: 2min video -> 100MB x 1M per day = 100PB per year (object storage)\n\nENTITIES:\nUser (userId, name, info about user)\nTask (taskId, userId, status, user query...)\n\nAPI:\nPOST /v1/video\nbody: {query}\nResponse: {taskId, status}\n\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
