      "text": "Movie ticket booking system",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Movie ticket booking system",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "W-hk_hShErZeFUAROb1LT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1239.7868507713283,
      "y": 11995.03409357704,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 875,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFp",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1000030576,
      "version": 1225,
      "versionNonce": 730034544,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792281727585,
      "created": 1792280062403,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\nDesign an online movie ticket booking system, similar to BookMyShow.\nUsers should be able to browse movies, view available showtimes and\nseats, and book tickets.\nMultiple users might try to book the same seat simultaneously.\n\nFUNC REQ:\n- user should be able to browser shows\n- book selected seats and get tickets\n\nNON FUNC REQ:\n- 1M DAU = 10 rps for browsing and booking\n- during famous celeb shows 100M users spike will be browsing and\nbooking = 1k rps and assuming like each user sends 5 requests so 5k rps\n- avoid duplicate booking; seat conflicts; strong consistency during\nbooking\n- during peak our servers should still display shows; strong\navailability\n\nENTITIES:\nUser (userId, name, info)\nMovie (movieId, name, ..)\nShow (showId, movieId, location, time) \nSeat (seatId, showId, status (AVAILABLE|BLOCKED|CONFIRMED)\nTicket (ticketId, seatId)\nBooking (bookingId, showId, userId, paymentDetails, ticketId)\n\nAPI:\nGET /v1/show?location=Seattle?date=12-31-2026.. -> {movie[]}\n\nGET /v1/show/{showId} -> {show info, seat map}\n\nPOST /v1/book/{venueId}\nbody: {seat[], paymentInfo}\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\nDesign an online movie ticket booking system, similar to BookMyShow.\nUsers should be able to browse movies, view available showtimes and seats, and book tickets.\nMultiple users might try to book the same seat simultaneously.\n\nFUNC REQ:\n- user should be able to browser shows\n- book selected seats and get tickets\n\nNON FUNC REQ:\n- 1M DAU = 10 rps for browsing and booking\n- during famous celeb shows 100M users spike will be browsing and booking = 1k rps and assuming like each user sends 5 requests so 5k rps\n- avoid duplicate booking; seat conflicts; strong consistency during booking\n- during peak our servers should still display shows; strong availability\n\nENTITIES:\nUser (userId, name, info)\nMovie (movieId, name, ..)\nShow (showId, movieId, location, time) \nSeat (seatId, showId, status (AVAILABLE|BLOCKED|CONFIRMED)\nTicket (ticketId, seatId)\nBooking (bookingId, showId, userId, paymentDetails, ticketId)\n\nAPI:\nGET /v1/show?location=Seattle?date=12-31-2026.. -> {movie[]}\n\nGET /v1/show/{showId} -> {show info, seat map}\n\nPOST /v1/book/{venueId}\nbody: {seat[], paymentInfo}\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "yH5dAzzSlhgUk89IE-eBk",
      "type": "ellipse",
      "x": -253.64724396645016,
      "y": 12310.34680861616,
      "width": 125.3786239723064,
