      "version": 685,
      "versionNonce": 842472336,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792289617660,
      "created": 1792286325792,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Design a distributed job scheduler similar to a simplified version of\nApache Airflow.\nUsers or other services can submit jobs to execute at a specific time.\nExamples:\n- Send a report at midnight.\n- Run a database cleanup every hour.\n- Execute a background data-processing task at a scheduled time.\nThe system should support both one-time and recurring jobs.\nScope: Assume jobs are predefined tasks executed by our workers. No need\nto support arbitrary user-uploaded code or complex workflow\ndependencies.\n\nFUNC REQ:\n- our system should accept jobs and run/schedule them\n- should support cron jobs and one time\n- track status\n\nNON FUNC REQ:\n- 1M jobs can be submitted per day = 10 jobs per sec\n- async working; system should be highly available\n- \n\nDATA MODEL:\nUser (userId, info..)\nJob (jobId, userId, status [SUBMITTED,QUEUED,RUNNING,FAILED,COMPLETED],\nstartAt, recurringTime)\n\nAPI:\nPOST /v1/job -> {jobId, status}\nbody: {job info}\n\nGET /v1/job/{jobId} -> {status}\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Design a distributed job scheduler similar to a simplified version of Apache Airflow.\nUsers or other services can submit jobs to execute at a specific time.\nExamples:\n- Send a report at midnight.\n- Run a database cleanup every hour.\n- Execute a background data-processing task at a scheduled time.\nThe system should support both one-time and recurring jobs.\nScope: Assume jobs are predefined tasks executed by our workers. No need to support arbitrary user-uploaded code or complex workflow dependencies.\n\nFUNC REQ:\n- our system should accept jobs and run/schedule them\n- should support cron jobs and one time\n- track status\n\nNON FUNC REQ:\n- 1M jobs can be submitted per day = 10 jobs per sec\n- async working; system should be highly available\n- \n\nDATA MODEL:\nUser (userId, info..)\nJob (jobId, userId, status [SUBMITTED,QUEUED,RUNNING,FAILED,COMPLETED], startAt, recurringTime)\n\nAPI:\nPOST /v1/job -> {jobId, status}\nbody: {job info}\n\nGET /v1/job/{jobId} -> {status}\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
