      "text": "BEGIN;\n\nSELECT *\nFROM jobs\nWHERE run_at <= NOW()\n  AND status = 'SCHEDULED'\nORDER BY run_at, job_id\nLIMIT 1000\nFOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED;",
