    {
      "id": "Aja0P6fpJRJwBA6OUOdef",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1153.7308496526284,
      "y": 17685.476777826254,
      "width": 612.6795654296875,
      "height": 850,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bK2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2099264368,
      "version": 1055,
      "versionNonce": 924479344,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792385034190,
      "created": 1792373757510,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Design the architecture of a Peloton class ranking system\n\nexercising bike\nchoose diff configurations (lengths, strength..)\nclasses length : (15, 20min)\nranking: \n\nuserA -> climbing, hiit, \nuserB -> sprint based\n\nrecommend -> classes (climbing; strength; hiit)\n\nPeloton class user db -> user stats -> recommend\n\nFUNC REQ:\n-  our system should be able to rank the classes for each user\n\nNON FUNC REQ:\n- scale: 1M DAU -> 1M / day = 1M/10^5 ~50 req per sec\n- high avail\n- durable storage\n- latency: p99 under 200ms \n- near real time\n- SSE\n\nDATA MODEL:\n- User (userId, name, age, weight,...)\n- Class (id, duration, type..)\n- \n\nAPI:\nuser can see other class members \n- GET /class/recommend -> {recommended class list[]}\n- stream the user's current stat ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Design the architecture of a Peloton class ranking system\n\nexercising bike\nchoose diff configurations (lengths, strength..)\nclasses length : (15, 20min)\nranking: \n\nuserA -> climbing, hiit, \nuserB -> sprint based\n\nrecommend -> classes (climbing; strength; hiit)\n\nPeloton class user db -> user stats -> recommend\n\nFUNC REQ:\n-  our system should be able to rank the classes for each user\n\nNON FUNC REQ:\n- scale: 1M DAU -> 1M / day = 1M/10^5 ~50 req per sec\n- high avail\n- durable storage\n- latency: p99 under 200ms \n- near real time\n- SSE\n\nDATA MODEL:\n- User (userId, name, age, weight,...)\n- Class (id, duration, type..)\n- \n\nAPI:\nuser can see other class members \n- GET /class/recommend -> {recommended class list[]}\n- stream the user's current stat ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
