      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792464786004,
      "created": 1792464677548,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "REQS:\nPUT, GET, DELETE operations.\nSupport 1 billion keys.\nHandle 10K average / 50K peak RPS.\np99 latency under 100 ms.\nHigh availability and durable writes.\nEventual consistency between replicas.\n\nDATA MODEL:\nkey\nvalue\nversion\n\nAPI:\nPUT /kv/{key} -> {success}\nbody: {value}\n\nGET /kv/{key} -> {key: value}\n\nDELETE /kv/{key} => {delete success code}",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "REQS:\nPUT, GET, DELETE operations.\nSupport 1 billion keys.\nHandle 10K average / 50K peak RPS.\np99 latency under 100 ms.\nHigh availability and durable writes.\nEventual consistency between replicas.\n\nDATA MODEL:\nkey\nvalue\nversion\n\nAPI:\nPUT /kv/{key} -> {success}\nbody: {value}\n\nGET /kv/{key} -> {key: value}\n\nDELETE /kv/{key} => {delete success code}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
